      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "District 9's influence extends beyond its immediate contemporaries. The film's success paved the way for more politically charged sci-fi like <a href=\"/movie/110415\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"110415\">Snowpiercer</a> (2013) and <a href=\"/movie/424781\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"424781\">Sorry to Bother You</a> (2018). Its documentary aesthetic influenced found-footage sci-fi like <a href=\"/movie/174772\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"174772\">Europa Report</a> (2013) and Phoenix Forgotten (2017), while its blend of body horror and social commentary echoes in films like <a href=\"/movie/500664\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"500664\">Upgrade</a> (2018) and <a href=\"/movie/435615\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"435615\">Possessor</a> (2020)."
